{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":5,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1483706677,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDkxMzk4OTYwMg=="},"added":["severity-normal"],"removed":[]},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1483713346,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MDkxNTAyNA==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1179#issuecomment-270915024"},"message":"Looks like we need to reimplement get_toppath() without `rev-parse`.","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"819663238374c863923453c36b916c251f565216"},"timestamp":1483958755,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MTI1NTA4Nw==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1179#issuecomment-271255087"},"message":"Not necessarily. Since it's currently a classmethod it just fails to know we are in direct mode, which is bound to an instance of course:\n\n```\ntmp/demo % git annex direct  \ncommit  \nOn branch master\n\nInitial commit\n\nnothing to commit\nok\ndirect  ok\n/tmp/demo % git rev-parse --show-toplevel\n/tmp/demo % git -c core.bare=false rev-parse --show-toplevel\n/tmp/demo\nben@tree /tmp/demo % \n```\n\nSo, we could fix it by binding it to instances instead.","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1483964262,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MTI3MTA0Ng==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1179#issuecomment-271271046"},"message":"Cool!","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1484061481,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MTYwMjEwOA==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1179#issuecomment-271602108"},"message":"@bpoldrack sadly, this doesnt seem to work with git 2.11.0","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"819663238374c863923453c36b916c251f565216"},"timestamp":1484061669,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MTYwMzA2MQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1179#issuecomment-271603061"},"message":"Oh, okay. What does happen with 2.11.0? Just the same result as without the option?","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1484061927,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MTYwNDM0NA==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1179#issuecomment-271604344"},"message":"Setting core.bare via -c just for the call has no effect. But if I change it in the config file it does what you showed...","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"819663238374c863923453c36b916c251f565216"},"timestamp":1484062287,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MTYwNjE3NQ==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1179#issuecomment-271606175"},"message":"That's interesting. May be an even more general issue with 2.11.0","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"819663238374c863923453c36b916c251f565216"},"timestamp":1484223595,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MjE0OTc0Nw==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1179#issuecomment-272149747"},"message":"Correction: Actually, it doesn't make sense to bind it to Repo instances, since we wouldn't ask for toppath if there was an instance already. Instead I overwrote it within `AnnexRepo` (still as a classmethod).\nFor now, this means `GitRepo.get_toppath` fails in direct mode, while `AnnexRepo.get_toppath` doesn't. This will change when I can merge PR #1091, for this provides a dedicated place for things like that. ATM just use `AnnexRepo.get_toppath`.\n\nHowever, note, that the issue with git 2.11.0 isn't resolved yet. I'll send a PR against Michael's and reference this issue.","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"819663238374c863923453c36b916c251f565216"},"timestamp":1484224344,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MjE1MTk4Nw==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1179#issuecomment-272151987"},"message":"Another observation worth noting: According to the tests, `get_toppath()` works with annex V6.","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1484231605,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MjE3Nzg0Nw==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1179#issuecomment-272177847"},"message":"yes, they have a worktree.","files":null},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1484483833,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDkyMzQ3OTc3Ng=="},"added":["fix-implemented"],"removed":[]},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1484483856,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MjY5MjU5Mg==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1179#issuecomment-272692592"},"message":"Two fixes would come with a merge of #1169","files":null},{"type":3,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1484765529,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI3MzU2NTM1NA==","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/1179#issuecomment-273565354"},"message":"Fix merged.","files":null},{"type":4,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1484765529,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50OTI3OTU2Nzc0"},"status":2},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1485179395,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDkzMjgyNjY1OA=="},"added":["bug-directmode"],"removed":[]},{"type":5,"author":{"id":"cf7a0bdf96b5195bf3052274368f463c7410f7a8"},"timestamp":1485179395,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDE0OlVubGFiZWxlZEV2ZW50OTMyODI2NjU5"},"added":[],"removed":["severity-normal"]}]}